{"id":183,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"品性と知性を磨き社会に貢献する6年教育","feature_description":"学習院女子中・高等科は、現代を生きる女性にふさわしい品性と知性を身につけ、社会に貢献する人を育てることを目指します。中1・中2の基礎課程で学ぶ楽しさと知識の土台を築き、中3・高1の応用課程で実験や実習を通して考える力を伸ばします。高2・高3の発展課程では文系・理系のコースと幅広い選択科目を設け、6年間を一つの流れとした教育で多様な進路に対応します。","clubs":[{"id":3393,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/sports/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3394,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/sports/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3396,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/sports/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3397,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/sports/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3398,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/sports/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3399,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/sports/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3400,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/sports/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3401,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/sports/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3402,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/sports/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3403,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/sports/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3404,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/culture/index.html","verified_at"